    "confidence": "verified",
    "note": "Eidolon ladder is cumulative: rank E_n grants E_1..E_n. E1 'Ablution of the Quick' = while the Zone is active all allies gain ATK +20% (luocha_e1) — applied on every OTHER ally's turn start, so invisible in the solo fixture (self excluded). E2 'Bestowal From the Pure' = Skill healing a target at >=50% HP grants a shield equal to 18% ATK plus 240 for 2 turns (luocha_e2_shield). E3 'Surveyal by the Fool' +Skill Lv.2 / Basic Lv.1 raises Basic 'Thorns of the Abyss' 0.30 -> 0.33. E4 'Heavy Lies the Crown' = while the Zone is active enemies are Weakened, dealing 12% less DMG (luocha_e4 weaken 0.12). E5 \"Cicatrix 'Neath the Pain\" +Ultimate Lv.2 / Talent Lv.2 raises Ultimate 'Death Wish' 2.0 -> 2.16. E6 'Reunion With the Dust' = Ultimate reduces all enemies' All-Type RES by 20% for 2 turns (luocha_e6 resAll -0.2)."
  },
